  "content": {
    "en": "termcn provides developers with genuine terminal and command-line style components designed for the browser. Drawing architecture from Ink and OpenTUI while adhering to shadcn copy-paste norms, termcn lets you embed interactive ASCII windows, ANSI logs, and shell prompts directly in React apps.",
    "zh": "termcn 是一套将命令行与终端审美完美带入浏览器的专用 React 组件库。借鉴了 Ink 与 OpenTUI 的底层排版逻辑，并深度契合 shadcn 即拷即用分发模式，它提供了具有纯正等宽排版、ANSI 颜色渲染、闪烁光标与流水日志输出的终端交互卡片。"
  },
